# --- solana-keygen grind output (SOC-271 addendum) ---
# `solana-keygen grind` writes hits as <pubkey>.json holding the secret key.
# Matches any basename of 47+ chars ending .json (a Solana pubkey is 32-44).
# If this ever shadows a legitimate long filename, negate it explicitly below.
??????????????????????????????????????????*.json

# --- BMAD per-developer config ---
# Installer-managed and scoped to one person (`user_name`, language, skill
# level). BMAD's own convention treats these as personal; committing them means
# every teammate's install rewrites them and conflicts on the way through.
_bmad/config.user.toml
_bmad/custom/config.user.toml
